{"id":"almohada","lemma":"almohada","pos":"noun","rank":2962,"glosses":["pillow (soft cushion used to support the head)"],"ipa":"/almoˈada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"almohadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-almohada.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Te traigo una almohada?","en":"Can I get you a pillow?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459070","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to bring","l":"traer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella duerme con dos almohadas.","en":"She sleeps with two pillows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937695","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null]},{"text":"Necesito una almohada extra.","en":"I need an extra pillow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460278","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"additional, extra"}]},{"text":"¿Cuántas almohadas usa para dormir?","en":"How many pillows do you use when sleeping?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152630","words":[{"g":"how many"},null,{"g":"to use","l":"usar"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to sleep"}]},{"text":"Ella lo asfixió con una almohada.","en":"She suffocated him with a pillow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589905","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to asphyxiate","l":"asfixiar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}